<!-- cell: plot id="397a460f-3636-47fb-9687-f747fed675bc" title="The politician and Captain Varn (high-level)" edges="8f0e0fd3-283f-4a15-9183-f1ed136c7ada:3b1a610d-84d3-40c2-91a2-94d384d91390>c3aa9247-0d38-4109-9bd5-48065cf611c1, b7b99b43-43a5-478b-a211-293e483adab1:c3aa9247-0d38-4109-9bd5-48065cf611c1>30551dae-9d7a-4957-8b6c-864ddb826305, 90201cfe-d66a-4e55-a2e2-38d0c5f4c91d:30551dae-9d7a-4957-8b6c-864ddb826305>78dfa670-e583-4271-b9bb-323fd6b5bb79" -->

<ol title="How a politician pretended to like Captain Varn, and came to love her.">
<li id="3b1a610d-84d3-40c2-91a2-94d384d91390" timestamp="1">The politician meets Captain Varn and pretends to like her, to get into her good graces. She tells him about her daughter, and that she is not looking for romance; he keeps playing coy.</li>
<li id="c3aa9247-0d38-4109-9bd5-48065cf611c1" timestamp="2">When Varn is sent to Mars, he arranges remote dates. They start talking about the future, and she asks him to look in on her daughter.</li>
<li id="30551dae-9d7a-4957-8b6c-864ddb826305" timestamp="3">A day with her daughter reminds him of his own childhood, and he is strangely moved. When his overseers want Varn pushed closer to the object, he voices concerns.</li>
<li id="78dfa670-e583-4271-b9bb-323fd6b5bb79" timestamp="4">As the alien fleet closes in, in a last desperate call, he realizes he loves her, and promises to look after her daughter.</li>
</ol>

<!-- cell: plot id="54d2a399-e38c-4f8e-8ba7-22e965ec879a" title="The politician and Captain Varn (low-level)" edges="9004b546-3abd-49e0-b5ad-e0e47d5d461d:b27fcca3-cf80-4241-b658-9a505feb075e>48e7772f-91a8-4a29-aeed-e43711d3e858, 34f96d13-6ba6-4eed-8c1c-b9233c49b7be:48e7772f-91a8-4a29-aeed-e43711d3e858>374c0da6-5fff-4063-bbf5-630fdbbacdb9, 3b9b61cb-fb4e-4539-967e-22a89df904d5:374c0da6-5fff-4063-bbf5-630fdbbacdb9>d95e8bae-814f-440c-8313-2c1fe2eec0d7, c258ebf7-7a2b-4254-8bb9-88b4942d09ba:d95e8bae-814f-440c-8313-2c1fe2eec0d7>2a276b38-e6d9-4db1-aef5-15c942b2ae6f, 355dfab7-a9b1-4ac1-9ae0-e2d7d41b976f:2a276b38-e6d9-4db1-aef5-15c942b2ae6f>604ce2a6-1ab6-4bdc-ba72-7b7526d6562e, 4ddebd67-671f-4317-88e4-30964a098efb:604ce2a6-1ab6-4bdc-ba72-7b7526d6562e>1d2cbbcf-2c53-48ff-a775-9fa5493261dd, a7bedf70-28eb-46a9-bb74-404e2c409c20:1d2cbbcf-2c53-48ff-a775-9fa5493261dd>b84d945c-ea9e-4266-874c-62fea7bec038, ec80fd7f-5470-4c6a-bc84-c9cbacefa19e:b84d945c-ea9e-4266-874c-62fea7bec038>5413d17f-ab61-45b0-8bf5-1a628fd98fc3, 3b8f9a8a-b99f-4db9-8ce9-9f51629efe98:5413d17f-ab61-45b0-8bf5-1a628fd98fc3>c3e8b8f1-dad3-460d-b9e8-a529481ff041" -->

<ol title="A politician courts Captain Varn for what she can tell him, keeps up remote dates when she is sent to Mars, is moved by a day with her daughter, and, as the alien fleet closes in, realizes he loves her and promises to look after the girl.">
<li id="b27fcca3-cf80-4241-b658-9a505feb075e" timestamp="1.1" location="earth, command center">The politician meets Captain Varn, and starts pretending to like her, to get into her good graces.</li>
<li id="48e7772f-91a8-4a29-aeed-e43711d3e858" timestamp="1.2" location="earth, a restaurant">He invites her to dinner. She tells him about her daughter, and that she is not looking for romance.</li>
<li id="374c0da6-5fff-4063-bbf5-630fdbbacdb9" timestamp="1.3" location="earth, a restaurant">They keep meeting, and he keeps playing coy.</li>
<li id="d95e8bae-814f-440c-8313-2c1fe2eec0d7" timestamp="1.4" location="earth, the politician's office">He learns that Varn is being sent with the mission to Mars: a relief, and at first an opportunity to learn more about the mysterious object.</li>
<li id="2a276b38-e6d9-4db1-aef5-15c942b2ae6f" timestamp="2.1" location="orbit">With Varn in space, he arranges remote dates: he calls her, and they start talking about the future.</li>
<li id="604ce2a6-1ab6-4bdc-ba72-7b7526d6562e" timestamp="2.2" location="orbit">On one of their calls, Varn asks him to check on her daughter, and he agrees.</li>
<li id="1d2cbbcf-2c53-48ff-a775-9fa5493261dd" timestamp="2.3" location="earth, Varn's house">He spends a day with her daughter, taking care of her. Among the photos of Varn and the stories the girl tells about her, something reminds him of his own childhood.</li>
<li id="b84d945c-ea9e-4266-874c-62fea7bec038" timestamp="3.1" location="orbit">The next time he calls Varn, he is strangely moved.</li>
<li id="5413d17f-ab61-45b0-8bf5-1a628fd98fc3" timestamp="3.2" location="earth, the company's offices">When his overseers order him to push Varn to investigate the object more closely, he voices concerns.</li>
<li id="c3e8b8f1-dad3-460d-b9e8-a529481ff041" timestamp="4.1" location="orbit">As the alien fleet closes in, in a last desperate call with Varn, he realizes that he loves her, and promises to look after her daughter.</li>
</ol>
